  <data name="ModelSampleContent" xml:space="preserve">
    <value># Focus Overlay

- Double-click the tray icon — **editor**
- Right-click — menu and **settings**
- `Ctrl+Alt+O` — show / hide
- `Ctrl+Alt+←` / `→` — tabs
- `Ctrl+Alt+P` — next preset</value>
